<p>You put all your focus into escaping combat for 4 turns. While under this effect you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">22%, 29%, 34%, 38%, 41%</acronym> increased resistance to all damage, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5.0, 6.7, 8.0, 9.0, 10</acronym> increased stamina regeneration, immunity to stun, pin, daze and slowing effects and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">150%, 217%, 268%, 311%, 350%</acronym> increased movement speed. </p><p>Any action other than movement will cancel this effect.</p>